      <DT><font color="#00FF00" size="3"><b>Epics keep rolling in</b></font>
      <font color="#FF0000" size="1"><br>Posted on 9/7/01 07:30 AM by </font>
      <font color="#FF0000" size="1"><b>Samita</b></font>
      <DD><font color="#FFFFCC"
size="2">Grats to Enkidu after a long wait.  He has his shammy poker after DoD bested two lords in CoM with a rag-tag crew... Lord Kick-yo-ass nearly got us as tanks started falling left and right, but chain heals and a few timely runes on Naktor won us the day!<br><br>Grats to Kenna for a Jade Reaver and final piece for Swiftwind!<br><br>Sithroth, Drue and Thornos also advanced a step in their epic hunts as the Mage piece dropped and 2 more of 3 total reavers in one clearing made it an ASTOUNDING night for DoD in CoM!<br><br>Samita Littlethorn - Hierophant<br>Mother Hobbit and<br>Officer in Dealers of Death</font><br><p align="center"><img src="http://www.dealersofdeath.com/images/divider.gif" width="380" height="36"></p><br><br>
    
      <DT><font color="#00FF00" size="3"><b>Congrats Corazon on a White Scale</b></font>
      <font color="#FF0000" size="1"><br>Posted on 8/29/01 01:00 PM by </font>
      <font color="#FF0000" size="1"><b>Samita</b></font>
      <DD><font color="#FFFFCC"
size="2">Gorenaire died at the hands of the Dealers.  After a long drought and more attempts than we'd have liked, Dealers finally started dealing Gore the death card again.<br><br>She was nice enough to present Corazon with a much needed scale as well as a few other nice trinkets and a bushel of spells.<br><br>Samita Littlethorn - Hierophant<br>Mother Hobbit and<br>Officer in Dealers of Death</font><br><p align="center"><img src="http://www.dealersofdeath.com/images/divider.gif" width="380" height="36"></p><br><br>
    
      <DT><font color="#00FF00" size="3"><b>Two new Epics</b></font>
      <font color="#FF0000" size="1"><br>Posted on 8/27/01 08:23 AM by </font>
      <font color="#FF0000" size="1"><b>Samita</b></font>
      <DD><font color="#FFFFCC"
size="2">Congrats go to Alanna for completing her Snake-stick<br>And a HUGE! OOGGA for DoD to rally during early work hours to race to Ragefire and win to give Serokk a limp noodle-o-rez.<br><br>After an entire weekend camp with a no-show dragon the spawn was called and people slipped from work as they could for an amazing weekday showing in Sol B.  Fantastic work Dealers.<br><br>Edit: And I just noticed we missed a posting from our Sky trip last week.  6 or more blades were gotten for guild warriors and 3 Cloaks for the Necros.  Thus completing two Necro Epics for our guild.  Grats Evilosi and Karle<br><br>Samita Littlethorn - Hierophant<br>Mother Hobbit and<br>Officer in Dealers of Death</font><br><p align="center"><img src="http://www.dealersofdeath.com/images/divider.gif" width="380" height="36"></p><br><br>
    
