      <DD><font color="#FFFFCC"
size="2">I don't have the death pic on this machine, hopefully Greymar can post one.<br>Finally got that ugly monkey off our back. Gratz to Larka (eye), Aaethedor(robe) and Elesa (choker). The First of hopefully many deaths for the vile CT<br>at the hands of DoD.<br><br>stole a pic...<br><IMG SRC="http://www.senlir.com/everquest/080101Hate-CTDead.jpg"><br><br>Megatryphe Tempestbourne<br>Dealers of Death Officer<br>The Needs of the Many...<br></font><br><p align="center"><img src="http://www.dealersofdeath.com/images/divider.gif" width="380" height="36"></p><br><br>
    
